Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Modern Identity Protocol Exploitation Toolkit
 Aether is a low-level protocol exploitation toolkit for modern
 identity fabrics. It provides PRT→OAuth conversion, WS-Trust/SAML
 relaying, Conditional Access policy evaluation, cloud VM command
 execution, cross-cloud Kerberos pivoting, and encrypted engagement
 workspaces — all from a single static binary.
 .
 It is designed for authorized penetration testing and red team
 operations against hybrid cloud environments.
